Affected areas: tolerant lexing and parsing (Pdf.Core.Lexer, Pdf.Core.Parser),
cross-reference reconstruction (Pdf.Core.XRef), stream filters
(Pdf.Core.Filters) and the standard security handler (Pdf.Core.Crypto,
Pdf.Core.Encryption).

The test PDFs under Tests/Data were generated for this project.

Demo/Styles/Dark.style is the "Dark" FireMonkey style that ships with
Embarcadero Delphi, redistributed with the demo application under the Delphi
license terms for style files. It is only used by Demo/PdfViewerDemo.
